        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "*As the property is currently vacant, we have used illustrations of the interior to demonstrate potential look and feel *\r\n\r\nHegarty Properties are delighted to present this stunning detached residence, tucked away in a tranquil setting, enjoying complete privacy in a most convenient location. \r\nConstructed in 1992, this substantial five-bedroom residence extends to approx. 242 sq. m. (2,595.4 sq. ft.) The home is perfectly positioned to maximise natural light throughout.  \r\nLocation is one of this property's most attractive features. Situated on the peripheral of the thriving town of Midleton, the home enjoys the perfect balance of privacy and accessibility. Adjacent to the N25, it offers excellent connectivity to Cork City and surrounding areas. Midleton town centre is within walking distance and provides an extensive range of amenities including schools, shops, restaurants, cafés, sporting facilities, and public transport links.\r\nThis is a rare opportunity to acquire a substantial detached family home in a highly sought-after location, offering exceptional space both inside and out, mature landscaped grounds, and a peaceful setting close to every convenience. \r\nAccommodation: Large Entrance Hallway, Kitchen/Dining Area, Living Room, Sun Room, Family Room, Utility Room, Guest W.C, 5 Bedrooms (1 ensuite), Family Bathroom and Large detached Garage.  \r\nCirca 242 sq. m (2,595.4 sq. ft.) \r\nGuide Price: €695,000"
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "Ground Floor:\r\nLarge Entrance Hallway:\tWelcoming hallway with carpet flooring.\r\n\r\nKitchen/ Dining Room: \tFully fitted kitchen with tiled splashback. Tiled flooring. \r\n\r\nUtility Room:\tDual aspect utility room with painted fitted storage units. Plumbed for washing machine and dryer.  Tiled flooring. Door to side garden.\r\n\r\nFamily Room: \tBright, generous sized room with dual aspect, open fireplace with fitted stove and carpet flooring. Door to sitting room. \r\n\r\nSitting Room: \tLarge, bright room with dual aspect. Feature open fireplace with stove and wood flooring. Double doors to: \r\n\r\nSunroom:\t                       Tiled flooring and doors to rear garden. \r\n\r\nBedroom 5/ Office: \t           Bright, dual aspect room with walk-in storage and carpet flooring. \r\n\r\nGuest W.C:                           W.C., & w.h.b. Fully tiled.  \r\n\r\nFirst Floor:\r\n\r\nMain Bedroom: \t          Large bedroom with dual aspect. Built-in storage with vanity table. Carpet flooring. \r\n\r\nEnsuite:\tWC, wash hand basin and shower. Fully tiled.\r\n\r\nBedroom 2: \t\t\tRear aspect room with carpet flooring. \r\n\r\nBedroom 3: \tRear aspect room with carpet flooring. \r\n\r\nBedroom 4:                           Generous double room with dual aspect. Carpet flooring. \r\n\t\r\nFamily Bathroom: \tWC, wash hand basin and bath with overhead shower. Built in mirrored storage cabinet. Fully tiled. \r\n\r\nOutside:\r\nTotally private and secluded property with sweeping tarmac driveway to parking forecourt. Landscaped gardens of circa 0.56 acre which boasts a sunny orientation and include mature trees and flowering shrubs. Outside tap. Large detached garage with dual aspect. \r\n \r\nServices:  ▪ Mains water   ▪ O.F.C.H."
      },
